5) Notes for defense/evaluation
- Primary bug is unsafe gets().
- Blacklisting only execve syscall is incomplete as a generic mitigation.
- Prefer bounded input APIs and defense-in-depth (canaries, NX, ASLR, seccomp allowlists).

